            "Item contains keys to a vehicle or property",
            "Item is a mobility, hearing, or vision aid",
            "Item has high stated value",
            "Item contains data the claimant is concerned about",
            "Item is perishable"
          ],
          "guidance": "A mobility, hearing, or vision aid, or a medication, is treated as urgent and escalated to the responsible manager immediately."
        }
      ]
